The meetings endpoints (POST /meetings, PUT /meetings/{domain}/{id}, GET /meetings/{domain}/{id}, GET /meetings/list) expose a `type` field (`"immediate"` or `"scheduled"`) on the meeting object starting at API version V19: required on create, optional on update (omitting it keeps the stored type). Meetings created via V15–V18 endpoints and all pre-existing meetings are `scheduled`. The V17/V18 endpoint shapes are unchanged.
